          "entry_id": 1451,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.66659737,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How much will my visit cost if I am paying out-of-pocket?\nAnswer: Out-of-pocket rates are $120 for a General Practitioner (GP) visit, $180 for a Dentist appointment, and $160 for all other specialist consultations.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 1450,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.43283325,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insurer for potential reimbursement.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 1452,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.30890992,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: When is payment due, and what payment methods do you accept?\nAnswer: Payment is due at the time of service. We accept cash, major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), and Flexible Spending Account (FSA) / Health Savings Account (HSA) cards.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 1453,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.28248435,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What are your clinic hours and locations?\nAnswer: We are open Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM at 15a Willson St. The nearest free parking is a 3-minute walk away at the Mega Mall parking garage (9 Willson St.).",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 1446,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.2634083,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do I need a referral from a primary care doctor to book with a specialist?\nAnswer: You can book a visit with any of our practitioners without a referral.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 1447,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.25513232,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I bring to my first appointment?\nAnswer: Please bring a valid photo ID, your insurance card, and any relevant prior lab or test results related to your case.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 1448,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.24780187,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 1454,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.24303281,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How early should I arrive before my scheduled appointment time?\nAnswer: If it is your first visit to our clinic, please arrive 15 minutes before your appointment time to complete your regist",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 1449,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.20210734,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Which health insurance plans do you accept?\nAnswer: We accept most major insurance providers, including Blue Cross Blue Shield, Aetna, Cigna, UnitedHealthcare, and Medicare. If you're unsure",
          "text_truncated": true
        }
      ],
